- delay in $absdelay is a constant.
- filter contribution to potential, uses internal node.
- ac needs operating point, even if linear:
  c.f. mg2_cccs.0.gc
- $write etc. not working in analog functions
- net assign: only nodes in rhs expression
- net assign: delay arg is constant
- final_step, initial_step lacks arg
- paramset expansion uses localparam "kludge"

